  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 10316931072
    m_Localized: 'Every attempt to study the anomaly has failed. The scientific expedition
      that had turned on the drainage stations never returned... and that''s not
      even the worst part.


      Something has awakened deep beneath the Earth,
      and its influence is slowly corrupting our planet.


      We believe that
      by shutting down the stations and reflooding the basin, this ancient presence
      may return to oblivion.


      You are our last hope.


      Take that old
      service hot air balloon, reach every station, and shut them down.


      Always
      maintain a safe altitude... keep an eye on those indicators.


      Good luck.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
